{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\":\"final_status.json\",\"summary\":\"Submitted unchanged; validated as no_change with no effects, and the run is at its stopping point with about four minutes left, which cannot accommodate a probe and its citation. Final state of the research: two sourced defects in hashicorp/raft's RestoreCommittedLogs path, each with an experiment-cited account whose conclusion is violated and whose defect claim is asserted, plus one source-analyzed open question. Configuration recovery (98ee8dfd5fac4b84915f91ed4b094bcf-question-0) rests on eight retained receipts - the single-voter recovery cases with flag-off controls, the three-voter commit-rule witness reproduced in four receipts where the entry was committed and reported successful while a real voter lacked it, the durable-snapshot corruption that survived a restart with the replay disabled, the authority pair with a repeat whose premise failed and a revision that enforces it, and the two-voter vote boundary in two executions showing that the defect removes candidacy but not participation. Replay completion (29e4214f5ee146b393957fa23a33a73d-question-0) rests on eleven receipts - the block pair, the measured bound pair, the availability consequence at two batch sizes, the exact 128-versus-129 delivered-batch boundary at two batch sizes, and reachability with the library's default snapshot settings - with the bound stated as 128 x MaxAppendEntries delivered batches. The open question dec7dd4ba25743138e52303340152c0c-question-0 carries a source analysis of InstallSnapshot propagation, including the persistent path through a stale-configuration leader's own later snapshot and the compaction rule that forbids removing logs after a snapshot, with a discriminator and no execution. Across the run, three knowledge corrections were recorded with changed premises, affected uses marked and gaps answered; 54 claims across 14 receipts were verified against the observations with no discrepancy and every cited source anchor re-checked; one internal contradiction was repaired; and the predecessor receipt that failed inside its own harness is retained without a comparison claim. Remaining limits are structural to the in-memory harness and are stated per account; expiry preserves this state.\"}"}}
